        "TRAPS confirmed by TNFRSF1A mutations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "cryopyrin-associated-periodic-syndrome",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "CAPS has urticarial rash, not maculopapular",
